#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:23
msgid "Getting Permission to Create Records"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:25
msgid "To create records, you must obtain write access either:"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:27
msgid "as an individual submitter, referred to as a standalone depositor; or"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:28
msgid "through a community role that permits record submission."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:32
msgid ""
"Write access is intended primarily for employees and students of eligible"
" academic and research\n"
"      institutions in the Czech Republic, their international "
"collaborators, and other approved users whose\n"
"      intended use is consistent with the mission of the repository."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:38
msgid ""
"During the application process, you may be asked to describe your "
"intended use of the repository\n"
"      and justify your request for access."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:45
msgid "Becoming a Standalone Depositor"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:47 ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:72
msgid "To apply:"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:49
msgid "Click on the button below and submit the application form."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:51
msgid ""
"Wait for your application to be reviewed. Applications may require manual"
" evaluation,\n"
"              so approval may not be immediate. You will receive an email"
" notification when the\n"
"              application has been processed."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:56
msgid ""
"After your application is approved, sign in to the Data Catch-all "
"Repository and\n"
"              create your first record."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:69
msgid "Getting Access Through a Community"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:71
msgid "Open membership communities"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:74
msgid "Navigate to the community page"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:75
msgid "Click on the \"Request Membership\" button"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:76
msgid "Fill in the form, stating the reason for joining"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:77
msgid "You will receive an email when your request is approved or rejected."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:78
msgid "You can track the status of your request on your Dashboard under Requests."
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:81
msgid "Closed membership communities"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages/templates/GetAccess.jinja:82
msgid ""
"You cannot apply to these communities online; you need to contact the "
"community manager directly.\n"
"            If you do not already have a contact email address,\n"
"            check the community's About page or contact us at\n"
"            <a href=\"mailto:datarepo@eosc.cz\">datarepo@eosc.cz</a>."
msgstr ""

